Offline screenshot recognition uses Tesseract.js 6.0.1 and Tesseract.js-core 6.0.0 (Apache-2.0), with chi_sim and eng trained-data packages 1.0.0 from naptha/tessdata. The npm data wrappers declare MIT; the underlying Tesseract trained data retains Apache-2.0. Sources: https://github.com/naptha/tesseract.js, https://github.com/naptha/tesseract.js-core, https://github.com/naptha/tessdata, https://github.com/tesseract-ocr/tessdata. Spreadsheet and ZIP export uses fflate 0.8.2, Copyright (c) 2023 Arjun Barrett, MIT. Models are bundled locally; no OCR service receives bill images.
